top: apollo_luminary_core
description: >
  Source-only, Apollo 11 Luminary 099-inspired Block II AGC execution test.
  Synthesizes one clocked PICADS circuit with instruction fetch, a 15-bit
  accumulator, Z and Q registers, control flags, I/O latch and unified
  32-word erasable/program store. The external host preloads instruction
  words through the program/load port. Not a flight-software interpreter,
  authentic fixed-memory rope, or complete Apollo Guidance Computer.
modules:
  - name: AGCInstructionSequencer
    function: apollo_luminary_core
    purpose: >
      One generated sequential microcomputer; actual instruction fetch from
      on-chip memory, branch/control decoding, AGC-style 1s-complement
      arithmetic, and selected Luminary start initialization.
